# Build output of the examples or of your own project, so `git status` stays clean
# after compiling. Scoped to avoid the shipped toolchain: it carries crt*.o
# (crti.o, crtbegin.o, ...) and a linker script, which a blanket `*.o` would
# silently exclude from the branch.
**/build/
**/*.d
**/*.map
**/*.syms
